flowchart TB
 subgraph CC[Portable containerized capability capsule]
  M[Declared inputs, outputs, effects and pinned dependencies]
  A[Capability A: tool or skill]
  B[Capability B: MCP or bounded subagent]
  V[Guards, gates and dedicated verifiers]
  I[Image pinned by digest and dependency lock]
  M --> A & B
  V --- A & B
  I --- M
 end
 N[Sandboxed agent: current need and inputs] --> F[Filter compatibility, permissions and scoped trust]
 F --> R[Rank eligible capabilities by relevance]
 R --> T[Bind and check invocation]
 T --> A
 A --> O[Checked artifacts and attributable receipts]
 O --> H[Historical performance by release and workload]
 H --> Q[Independent quality policy and reevaluation]
 Q --> F
 X[External tool, skill, MCP or subagent caller] --> T
 H -. evidence for permitted optimization .-> E[RSI candidate: independent admission required]
